cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use EQUAL, please cite it as below.
title: "EQUAL: One Cassette, Both Sides of the API"
authors:
  - family-names: Balanov
    given-names: Anton
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
url: https://balanov.pro/equal/
repository-code: https://github.com/Balanov/equal
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  EQUAL is a language-neutral HTTP compatibility laboratory. It records real
  SDK traffic into a redacted JSONL cassette, replays it offline, and verifies
  another API implementation with semantic, field-level differences.
keywords:
  - API compatibility
  - record and replay
  - contract testing
  - differential testing
  - clean-room implementation
